<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja"><head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>記事タイトル</title>
    <style>
        .text-block {
            text-align: center;
        }
        /* ——— base style ——— */
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','メイリオ','Meiryo',sans-serif;
            line-height: 2; color: #e0e0e0; background: #000; padding: 0; cursor: none;
        }

        #cursor {
            position: fixed; width: 12px; height: 12px; pointer-events: none; z-index: 9999;
            transform: translate(-50%,-50%);
            background: radial-gradient(circle,#fff 0%,#fff 40%,#ffeecc 70%,transparent 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px #fff,0 0 30px #fff,0 0 45px #ffeecc;
            clip-path: polygon(50% 0%,61% 35%,98% 35%,68% 57%,79% 91%,50% 70%,21% 91%,32% 57%,2% 35%,39% 35%);
            animation: starMorph 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes starMorph {
            0%,100% { clip-path: polygon(50% 0%,61% 35%,98% 35%,68% 57%,79% 91%,50% 70%,21% 91%,32% 57%,2% 35%,39% 35%); }
            25% { clip-path: polygon(50% 5%,65% 30%,95% 40%,70% 55%,85% 90%,50% 75%,15% 90%,30% 55%,5% 40%,35% 30%); }
            50% { clip-path: polygon(50% 2%,58% 38%,96% 32%,66% 60%,82% 88%,50% 68%,18% 88%,34% 60%,4% 32%,42% 38%); }
            75% { clip-path: polygon(50% 8%,63% 33%,92% 38%,72% 58%,77% 93%,50% 72%,23% 93%,28% 58%,8% 38%,37% 33%); }
        }

        .cursor-trail { position: fixed; width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%; pointer-events: none; z-index: 9998; animation: trailFade 2s ease-out forwards; }
        @keyframes trailFade { 0%{ transform: scale(1); opacity:0.9 } 100%{ transform: scale(0); opacity:0 } }

        .container { max-width:100%; margin:0; background:#000; }

        .top-link { background:#000; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-bottom:1px solid #333; }
        .top-link a {
            color:#e0e0e0; text-decoration:none; font-size:1.5em; font-weight:900;
            letter-spacing:0.3em; position:relative; z-index:2; font-family:'Impact','Arial Black',sans-serif;
            font-style:italic; text-transform:uppercase; transform:skewX(-10deg); display:inline-block;
            transition:color .3s;
        }
        .top-link a:hover { color:#fff; text-shadow:0 0 10px #9d00ff,0 0 20px #9d00ff; }

        @keyframes firework {
            0% { transform:translate(calc(-50% + var(--x)*0),calc(-50% + var(--y)*0)) scale(1); opacity:1; }
            100% { transform:translate(calc(-50% + var(--x)),calc(-50% + var(--y))) scale(0); opacity:0; }
        }
        .firework-particle {
            position:absolute; width:2px; height:2px; border-radius:50%; pointer-events:none;
            animation:firework 1.2s ease-out forwards;
        }

        header { color:#fff; padding:10px; text-align:center; border-bottom:1px solid #333; }
        h1 { font-size:1.4em; margin-bottom:15px; }
        .meta { font-size:0.75em; color:#999; }

        /* ===== タグセレクタ ===== */
        .tag-selector {
            margin-top: 10px;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 0.75em;
        }
        .tag-group {
            background: #111;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }
        .tag-group label {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #bbb;
        }
        .tag-group select {
            background: #000;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            border: 1px solid #444;
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            font-size: 0.75em;
            outline: none;
        }
        .tag-group select:focus {
            border-color: #9d00ff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(157,0,255,0.6);
        }

        article { padding:0; }

        .toolbar {
            position:sticky; top:0; background:#111; padding:15px; border-bottom:1px solid #333;
            display:flex; gap:10px; justify-content:center; z-index:100;
        }
        .toolbar button {
            background:#333; color:#e0e0e0; border:1px solid #555; padding:8px 15px;
            border-radius:3px; cursor:pointer; font-size:0.85em;
        }

        .content-block { padding:10px; border:1px solid transparent; transition:border-color .3s; position:relative; }
        .content-block:hover { border-color:#444; }

        .block-controls {
            position:absolute; top:5px; right:5px; opacity:0; display:flex; gap:5px; transition:opacity .3s;
        }
        .content-block:hover .block-controls { opacity:1; }

        .drag-handle { cursor:move; text-align:center; color:#555; font-size:0.8em; padding:5px; user-select:none; }
        .content-block.dragging { opacity:0.5; }

        .text-block h2 { color:#fff; font-size:0.9em; margin-bottom:10px; }
        .text-block p { font-size:0.85em; margin-bottom:10px; }

        .image-block img { max-width:100%; border:1px solid #333; }
        .audio-block audio { width:100%; max-width:500px; }

        /* 動画ブロック用 */
        .video-block video {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        footer { background:#2d3748; color:white; text-align:center; padding:10px; margin-top:20px; }

        .upload-prompt { border:1px dashed #555; padding:20px; text-align:center; cursor:pointer; color:#666; }
        input[type=file] { display:none; }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div id="cursor"></div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="top-link" id="topLink">
            <a href="../spaceship3.html" target="_blank">SPACESHIP</a>
        </div>

        <header>
            <h1><span style="font-size: 31.359999px;">週映光道 #１</span></h1>
            <div class="meta">公開日: 2026年4月24日 | 著者: ドドド</div>

            <!-- MODE / AREA / AURA タグの指定 UI -->
            <div class="tag-selector" style="margin-top: 10px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.75em;"><div style="background: rgb(17, 17, 17); border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 10px; color: rgb(187, 187, 187);"><span style="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-weight: 600;">MODE:</span> <span style="color: #e0e0e0;">DEPARTURE</span></div><div style="background: rgb(17, 17, 17); border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 10px; color: rgb(187, 187, 187);"><span style="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-weight: 600;">AREA:</span> <span style="color: #e0e0e0;">RURAL</span></div><div style="background: rgb(17, 17, 17); border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 10px; color: rgb(187, 187, 187);"><span style="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-weight: 600;">AURA:</span> <span style="color: #e0e0e0;">MIDNIGHT</span></div></div>
        </header>

        

        <!-- エクスポート名入力モーダル -->
        <div id="exportModal" style="display: none; position: fixed; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); z-index: 10000; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
            <div style="background:#111; border:2px solid #9d00ff; border-radius:10px; padding:30px; max-width:500px; width:90%;">
                <h3 style="color:#fff; margin-bottom:20px; text-align:center;">エクスポート設定</h3>
                
                <div style="margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <label style="color:#bbb; display:block; margin-bottom:8px; font-size:0.9em;">HTMLファイル名:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="htmlFileName" value="article" style="width:100%; padding:10px; background:#000; border:1px solid #444; border-radius:5px; color:#e0e0e0; font-size:1em;">
                    <div style="color:#666; font-size:0.75em; margin-top:5px;">※ .html は自動的に追加されます</div>
                </div>
                
                <div style="margin-bottom:30px;">
                    <label style="color:#bbb; display:block; margin-bottom:8px; font-size:0.9em;">ZIPファイル名:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="zipFileName" value="exported_page" style="width:100%; padding:10px; background:#000; border:1px solid #444; border-radius:5px; color:#e0e0e0; font-size:1em;">
                    <div style="color:#666; font-size:0.75em; margin-top:5px;">※ .zip は自動的に追加されます</div>
                </div>
                
                <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; justify-content:center;">
                    <button onclick="cancelExport()" style="background:#333; color:#e0e0e0; border:1px solid #555; padding:10px 30px; border-radius:5px; cursor:pointer; font-size:1em;">キャンセル</button>
                    <button onclick="confirmExport()" style="background:#9d00ff; color:#fff; border:none; padding:10px 30px; border-radius:5px; cursor:pointer; font-size:1em; font-weight:bold;">エクスポート</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <article id="editor" class="editor-container">
            
        <div class="content-block image-block">                        <img src="images/image_0_71DALq3jn-L._AC_SY445_SX342_QL70_ML2_.jpg"></div><div class="content-block text-block">                        <h2>見出し</h2>            <p><div style="text-align: center;"><br></div><p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;">　20人のブルジョワがオペラ鑑賞後にとある邸宅で形式的(現代的！)な晩餐をしている。その晩餐もそろそろ宴もたけなわ、皆ぼちぼち家路かと思うその瞬間、誰一人として部屋から出られなくなる。なんの障害物もない部屋の境界線からなぜか外への一歩を踏み出せない。何がそんな自体を招いているのか、その理由は最後まで宙ぶらりんなままで、そこから脱出することに最終的には成功してもだれもその原因を突き止めることはできない。音でさえ、何の仕切りもないはずのその部屋を超えて外部には届かず、外からもまた音が届かない。<br></p><p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;"><br></p><p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">60年以上前のこの映画を今更取り上げ、ブニュエルのブルジョワ批判に対する洗練されたアイロニカルなユーモアを礼賛してもあまり意味はないだろう。加えて私はブニュエルのカトリシズムに対するジレンマにも全く興味がない。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">　この映画において今重要なのは、謎の力によって外部との接続が許されない(またはその気力を奪う)部屋から、劇中においてただ一つの存在だけが何度もひょいひょいと境界線を飛び越え続けていることそれだけだ。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">　そして、そのただ一つの存在とは、他でもないこの映画を撮影しているカメラである。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">さらに言えば、闇で満たされた箱の中に座り、静かにそれを鑑賞している僕たちでもある。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;"><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">　その闇の中では、後ろを向けば光を出す小窓が見える。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">ビッグバンのように神秘的で、まだ何者でもないようでいて何者でもあるようなあの光を出す小窓から、スクリーンに向けて放射される。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">　映写機が光を浴びせるのは僕たちじゃなくてスクリーンであることを認識すべきだ。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">その光は僕たちのためには存在していない。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">スクリーンのためにある。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">じゃあスクリーンは何のためにある？</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">その光のため。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">そこに僕たちが介入する余地はない。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;"><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">　映写機と呼ばれる父によるその光と、スクリーンと呼ばれる光を受け止める母は、僕たちと全く関係のないところで、夫婦水入らずのセックスをしているだけ。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">その「映画」と名付けられた覗かれる宿命にあるセックスは、僕たちを認識しているのかはたまた認識していないのか、わからない。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;"><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">　スマートフォンから出される光は、前から来て後ろへ行くだけ。そこで後ろを見ても、光を感じることはできない。その光はただ虚空へ向かうのみであって、方向を失った単純でナイーブな矢でしかなく、目はスクリーンのように全てを受け止めることはできず、半ばレイプされるように動けなくなる。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">　それは、母が父に/父が母に内面化されたような権力の見えない自ら発光する面であるばかりでなく、その光はスマホを手に取っている他ならぬ自分ただ1人にのみ放射されていて、自分という主体も取り込んだ「閉じた回路（部屋）」となる。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;"><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">　大量のコンテンツによってできたデータベースから要素を組み換えただけに見える二次創作的な作品が乱立するのは、この近親相姦的な「閉じた回路（部屋）」によってあらゆる消費が支えられている現代のことを考えれば当然のことと言える。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">この回路内で消費される映画は、映画館で観る時のようにどっしりと構える操作不可能な自然のようなものではなく、見る主体が中断したり再開したり辞めたりできるものになる。その時点であらゆる映画はその回路内で素材に成り下がる。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;"><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">　映画館で上映前にスマートフォンの電源をオフにするようアナウンスするのは、周りの人の迷惑になるから、ではない。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">今は忘れられている、映写機という父が作り出す秩序をあらかじめ明確にするためである。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;"><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">　ところで君は、実の親のセックスを覗き見ちゃったことはある？僕は残念ながらないから、見たことがある人に嫉妬する。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;"><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">　つまり、</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;"><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">　ほとんどの映画館の中が真っ黒に満たされているのは、方向を失った「閉じた回路（部屋）」から出たくない/出られない僕たちの、捨てるべきナイーブなナルシズムを殺してしまうことに対して喪に服しているからである。（そしてもちろん、「皆殺しの天使」は白黒映画である）</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;"><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">「皆殺しの天使」のラスト、どうやったらこの部屋から出られるのか試行錯誤した結果、あの時の晩餐を、あの時した会話からなにから全て再現し直すことであの時私たちは帰りたかったんだという気持ちをやっと思い出し、「そうだ！もう夜も遅いし私たちずっと帰りたかったんだ！」とみんなで叫んで部屋から出られるようになるという、なんともアホらしいオチを笑って受け流しちゃいけない。ブニュエルが批判の対象とするブルジョワ的所作(現代的なやりとり！)はそんな単純なことすら忘れさせ、僕たちを幽閉する。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;"><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">そして最後に、ナイーブなナルシズムに屈したくはないというのが僕の今の本音である。</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;">スワイプするために進化してきたように思える親指と人差し指の、目がまわるような指紋の螺旋の中で迷子になる前に。</p></p></div></article>

